    "long_instructions": "# Your app: the Home screen\nApps follow **procedures**: a fixed list of steps that is the same every time. Clicking **Gallery** always opens the Gallery.\n\n1. Change the title to the name of your app. Change the text under it to say what your app does.\n2. Add an **About This App** button. When it is clicked, go to the **About This App** scene.",
